# Tier-1 sensing: median depth over the bin ROI → which layer is on top?
# Replaces the legacy 70%-count layer-completion heuristic (bin.py) with a
# measurement. Served by localization_node; called by cobot_node when a
# layer's targets are exhausted.

---
float64 median_z      # median depth over the bin ROI, mm
int8 layer_index      # nearest layer number derived from can_height_mm; -1 if unknown
